{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>8月31日，內地社交平台有網民爆料指，科大訊飛公關副總裁韓煜塵出軌女下屬，女下屬丈夫發佈22頁文件，爆出二人的露骨聊天記錄。同日，網上亦有消息指科大訊飛發佈通知免去韓煜塵職務，不過當事各方暫時均未有正式回應事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"網傳女方相片。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883541743931392756930.jpeg/t_WIKaj_d44ZzgP4-9UpSrdi7zQg4bEdllB4oZZQeKE\"/><figcaption>網傳女方相片。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳涉事高層。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171889472803966976074832.jpeg/sHmfc1EdlX3M9ka_0RGUujsORCwZ9LSfXaBDt12gQ7c\"/><figcaption>網傳涉事高層。（微博）</figcaption></figure><p>網傳涉事女員工的丈夫發文指控稱，妻子與上司已經出軌一年多，「多次出去開房」，並附上二人的聊天記錄。截圖顯示，朱女與韓煜塵互稱「寶寶」，二人還曾在聊天中談論「和我做愛」「還沒操夠」「吵完架又能做」等露骨話題。爆料者稱，涉事高層家中也有妻子孩子，「這麼做自己孩子不難過，妻子不難過嗎？」</p><figure><img alt=\"網傳聊天記錄。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883543992209408597803.jpeg/0Uqyi__Um1u11TkcUnZVKzjoqFONxx08GMG4YRjBuGE\"/><figcaption>網傳聊天記錄。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳聊天記錄。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171887863864758272475832.png/tAuFl74FCXbGSFMbx9RnjBJ_ewaasSfvl3oUDZd6FA0\"/><figcaption>網傳聊天記錄。（微博）</figcaption></figure><p>該消息流出的同一天，網上亦流出一份訊飛人事調整通知，指韓煜塵的品牌市場中心副總經理職務已被解除。</p><figure><img alt=\"網傳涉事高層。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171889554076995584637482.jpeg/Y-sCo5T4G7a4FcP2raeSL28BE4PqdIiL7z2rW-89q1s\"/><figcaption>網傳涉事高層。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"訊飛人事調整通知。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171889355644473344184203.jpeg/0IZJvAC72qS7nDJcEjJP2EVgCw1wsu70bGwa-GxsGvg\"/><figcaption>訊飛人事調整通知。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳女方相片。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883539529207808234810.jpeg/GoLpW6LW3jmYB-JOa9AOTmrVYdtpcy8Bx56dcceenXE\"/><figcaption>網傳女方相片。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳聊天記錄。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883537264152576638457.jpeg/Ul0cBXjktyjjYvsQf9T-dD7eFRcwyCcMC_i-kAv4vpA\"/><figcaption>網傳聊天記錄。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳聊天記錄。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883535045234688364197.jpeg/ijC-QoJlfgEwU4VDiGouMUNQ7AaUT1Nd1AVrDtQFaw4\"/><figcaption>網傳聊天記錄。（微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網傳女方相片。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171883705497554944382715.jpeg/aMzd0y6XlcyU8_L4RYKmPUDQsQ8HQZ0Asakb4bGpG-E\"/><figcaption>網傳女方相片。（微博）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T11:24:07.560362+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":10,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}